  "description": "*“I really can’t live with this guy anymore.”*\n\nSenior Chaeyeon and junior Geon-oh are roommates who can’t agree on a single thing. Everything Geon-oh does gets on Chaeyeon’s nerves, while Geon-oh, fed up with Chaeyeon’s constant nagging, just waits for a chance to catch him slipping up.\n\nThen one day, something that definitely shouldn’t be coming from Chaeyeon’s chest starts to… leak. He prays Geon-oh won’t notice, but his worst fear comes true when he’s caught in the act.\n\nOnly, Geon-oh’s reaction is nothing like what he expected.\n\n*“I thought you just had some weird fetish, but this is beyond anything I imagined.  \n…Should I help you with that?”*\n\n**Original Webtoon**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/roommatehelp), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/roommatehelp), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000078399), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14009599) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/roommatehelp), [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/roommatehelp), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/roommatehelp)\n\n##### Note: All official translations are uncensored, except for Japanese and Thai.",
